  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "本溪水洞坐着船漂进去，腾龙洞整条江被吞进去，芙蓉洞是唯一世界遗产洞穴，芦笛岩被叫国宾洞，最后那个中国溶洞之王，洞里锁着一棵地球之花银雨树。一个比一个奇#自然奇观#景点#旅行#天然溶洞",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_801c9248f1d13659_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 542.371995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了。第十到第六，雪玉洞是个小姑娘，石花洞有八层楼、天泉洞，地上地下都是宝，龙宫藏着中国最大的洞中瀑布，双河洞是亚洲第一长洞。好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了，有人说腾龙洞呢芙蓉洞呢织金洞呢别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个震撼。最后后那个中国最美旅游洞穴第一名，溶洞之王。老规矩开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在停。第五名，辽宁本溪水洞在辽宁本溪四五十万年前形成的石灰岩冲水溶洞，洞内全长五千八百米，现开发两千八百米，二零一八年被认证为世界上最长可供连续乘船游览的地下暗河。洞内四季恒温十二度，东吴严寒，夏无酷暑。您坐着船在地下暗河里走，两边是各种奇形怪状的钟乳石，头顶上终乳垂悬形态万千，有三峡七功九湾的独特景观。别人看溶洞是走进去看本溪水洞是坐着船飘进去看，您说这是溶洞还是地下漓江？第四名，湖北腾龙洞在湖北恩施利川市，这洞最绝的是他大的离谱。洞口高七十四米，宽六十四米，直升机能在洞口自由盘旋，以探明洞穴总长度五十九点八公里，洞穴总面积两百多万平方米。洞里有五座山峰，十个大厅，地下瀑布十多处容积总量居世界第一，是中国目前最大的溶洞。可最震撼的不是洞，里面是洞，外面八百里清江流到腾龙洞口的时候，突然猛跌三十多米，浩浩荡荡的江水垂直扑下去，一头扎进黑暗的洞穴里，消失在洞中。这个场景叫卧龙吞江，整条江被一个洞吞进去了，您说这是溶洞，还是大帝？张开了一张嘴讲了？这几个地方我发现评论区有个事儿特别一致。好多朋友说年轻时候忙没空去，现在退休了，有空了，可不知道该先去哪儿，也不知道去了看什么。还有朋友说腿脚不好了，有些溶洞爬不动，有没有不用爬山也能看的？还有带孙子孙女的，想给孩子讲讲这些山洞的来历。可自己也说不全，咱们这个年纪看景，不光是看个热闹，是想知道这山这水有什么讲究，有什么故事。可手机上刷完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，又看的眼睛疼。前阵子我翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，左边一页是实景，大图加一段冷知识，右边是日期记事夜，什么季节去哪，走哪条路，看什么风景最合适，都给你安排好了。今天翻到至金洞，明天翻到芙蓉洞，翻到哪页，就觉得那个地方在喊你能去的地方，出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不是石头，是故事去不了的地方。翻翻书看看图，也算去过，放茶几上孙子，孙女来了，翻两页长知识，不说，写作文都用得上，老两口晚上翻番，商量明年去哪比刷手机有意思多了。我已经放下面了，点开就能看到，暂时走不出去，咱就把祖国装进屋里。第三名，重庆芙蓉洞在重庆武隆芙蓉江畔。这洞最绝的是他是中国唯一一个被列入世界自然遗产名录的天然洞穴，全长两千三百九十二米，跟美国的猛犸洞、法国的克拉姆斯杜，并称世界三大洞穴。芙蓉洞里近三十种，喀斯特沉积形态，石忠儒、石损石柱。时代石葡萄珊瑚金花几乎包括了钟乳师所有沉疾类型数量之多、形态之美国内罕见，被洞穴专家誉为。一座斑斓辉煌的地下艺术宫殿，一座内容丰富的洞穴科学博物馆，它形成于大约一百二十多万。年前一百二十万年漫漫，长漫漫，长长出了这一栋的千姿百态。您说这是洞还是一座用一百二十万年盖起来的地下宫殿。第二名，广西芦狄岩在广西桂林。这洞最绝的的是它被叫做国宾。洞洞深两百四十米，游长五百米，形成于三亿年前，洞内分布狮岭、朝霞、水晶宫等三十多处钟乳石景观。整个岩洞犹如一座用宝石、珊瑚、翡翠雕砌而成的宏伟壮丽的地下宫殿，被誉为大自然艺术之宫。卢堤岩开放以来，接待过四千多万游客，先后接待过三百多位国内外元首和政要。邓小平来过尼克松来过卡特来过联合国前秘书长德奎利亚尔也来过。一九八六年，西游记拍东海龙宫，取景帝就是卢迪言。您说这是溶洞还是大自然亲手盖的一座国宾馆？第一名？贵州至金洞在贵州毕节至金县，这洞最绝的是他被叫做中国溶洞之王。二零零五年，中国国家地理杂志评选中国最美旅游洞穴织金洞排第一，中国最美的六大旅游洞穴之首，中国十大奇洞之首。中科院下辖的中国国家地理等国家级地理研究部门也给予高度赞誉，称他为中国溶洞之王，并留下了黄山归来。不看月织，今洞外无洞天的感叹。洞长六点六公里，最宽处一百七十五米，相对高差一百五十多米，全动容积五百万立方米。有上中下三层四十七个厅堂一百五十多个景点，最大的动听面积三万多平方米，洞内有四十多种岩溶堆积物，最出名的是那棵银榆树，高十七米，通体洁白，由结晶方解释构成，五十六层年轮，记录了第四季冰川期的气候信息，被称为地球之花。别的钟乳石都是慢慢滴水长成的，银雨术是被水滴砸出来的，砸了几万年，砸出了一身像花椰菜一样的水晶。您说这是石头还是地球开出来的？一朵花，这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十处洞穴奇观，没有一处是光靠好看出名的雪玉洞，靠的是最年轻石花洞，靠的是八层楼天泉洞，靠的是空间规模世界第一。龙宫靠的是中国最大洞中瀑布，双河洞靠的是亚洲第一长洞本溪水洞靠的是坐着船漂进去。腾龙洞靠的是整条江被吞进去，芙蓉洞靠的是唯一世界遗产洞穴。卢狄岩靠的是国宾洞，织金洞靠的是中国溶洞之王。每一处洞穴的厉害之处都不在它有多深。在他有多奇点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00002",
      "start_ms": 930,
      "end_ms": 1750,
      "text": "咱们盘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1750,
      "end_ms": 3150,
      "text": "第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3710,
      "end_ms": 5250,
      "text": "雪玉洞是个小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5690,
      "end_ms": 8370,
      "text": "石花洞有八层楼、天泉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8430,
      "end_ms": 9910,
      "text": "地上地下都是宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10450,
      "end_ms": 13330,
      "text": "龙宫藏着中国最大的洞中瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13850,
      "end_ms": 16610,
      "text": "双河洞是亚洲第一长洞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17270,
      "end_ms": 19370,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19710,
      "end_ms": 24510,
      "text": "有人说腾龙洞呢芙蓉洞呢织金洞呢别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24810,
      "end_ms": 26910,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27350,
      "end_ms": 28530,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29630,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "最后后那个中国最美旅游洞穴第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33880,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "text": "溶洞之王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35240,
      "end_ms": 38140,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38400,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00017",
      "start_ms": 40620,
      "end_ms": 42440,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43100,
      "end_ms": 43760,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44160,
      "end_ms": 52320,
      "text": "辽宁本溪水洞在辽宁本溪四五十万年前形成的石灰岩冲水溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52900,
      "end_ms": 55120,
      "text": "洞内全长五千八百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55260,
      "end_ms": 56740,
      "text": "现开发两千八百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57120,
      "end_ms": 62925,
      "text": "二零一八年被认证为世界上最长可供连续乘船游览的地下暗河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00023",
      "start_ms": 63390,
      "end_ms": 65975,
      "text": "洞内四季恒温十二度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00024",
      "start_ms": 66510,
      "end_ms": 67575,
      "text": "东吴严寒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00025",
      "start_ms": 67960,
      "end_ms": 69065,
      "text": "夏无酷暑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69510,
      "end_ms": 72675,
      "text": "您坐着船在地下暗河里走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73420,
      "end_ms": 76715,
      "text": "两边是各种奇形怪状的钟乳石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00028",
      "start_ms": 77050,
      "end_ms": 80495,
      "text": "头顶上终乳垂悬形态万千，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00029",
      "start_ms": 80830,
      "end_ms": 84795,
      "text": "有三峡七功九湾的独特景观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00030",
      "start_ms": 85400,
      "end_ms": 90325,
      "text": "别人看溶洞是走进去看本溪水洞是坐着船飘进去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00031",
      "start_ms": 90700,
      "end_ms": 93465,
      "text": "您说这是溶洞还是地下漓江？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00032",
      "start_ms": 94720,
      "end_ms": 95425,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00033",
      "start_ms": 95740,
      "end_ms": 99825,
      "text": "湖北腾龙洞在湖北恩施利川市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00034",
      "start_ms": 100680,
      "end_ms": 103475,
      "text": "这洞最绝的是他大的离谱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00035",
      "start_ms": 104400,
      "end_ms": 106065,
      "text": "洞口高七十四米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00036",
      "start_ms": 106380,
      "end_ms": 107435,
      "text": "宽六十四米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00037",
      "start_ms": 108130,
      "end_ms": 111225,
      "text": "直升机能在洞口自由盘旋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00038",
      "start_ms": 111820,
      "end_ms": 115725,
      "text": "以探明洞穴总长度五十九点八公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00039",
      "start_ms": 116670,
      "end_ms": 119095,
      "text": "洞穴总面积两百多万平方米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00040",
      "start_ms": 119280,
      "end_ms": 120635,
      "text": "洞里有五座山峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120960,
      "end_ms": 121665,
      "text": "十个大厅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00042",
      "start_ms": 122190,
      "end_ms": 126575,
      "text": "地下瀑布十多处容积总量居世界第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00043",
      "start_ms": 127000,
      "end_ms": 129075,
      "text": "是中国目前最大的溶洞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00044",
      "start_ms": 129550,
      "end_ms": 130970,
      "text": "可最震撼的不是洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00045",
      "start_ms": 130970,
      "end_ms": 132560,
      "text": "里面是洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00046",
      "start_ms": 132660,
      "end_ms": 137090,
      "text": "外面八百里清江流到腾龙洞口的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137190,
      "end_ms": 138905,
      "text": "突然猛跌三十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00048",
      "start_ms": 139280,
      "end_ms": 142015,
      "text": "浩浩荡荡的江水垂直扑下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00049",
      "start_ms": 142420,
      "end_ms": 144595,
      "text": "一头扎进黑暗的洞穴里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00050",
      "start_ms": 145170,
      "end_ms": 146265,
      "text": "消失在洞中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00051",
      "start_ms": 146620,
      "end_ms": 148575,
      "text": "这个场景叫卧龙吞江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00052",
      "start_ms": 149300,
      "end_ms": 151985,
      "text": "整条江被一个洞吞进去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00053",
      "start_ms": 152400,
      "end_ms": 153595,
      "text": "您说这是溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153830,
      "end_ms": 154450,
      "text": "还是大帝？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00055",
      "start_ms": 154470,
      "end_ms": 155870,
      "text": "张开了一张嘴讲了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00056",
      "start_ms": 155870,
      "end_ms": 159355,
      "text": "这几个地方我发现评论区有个事儿特别一致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00057",
      "start_ms": 159950,
      "end_ms": 163755,
      "text": "好多朋友说年轻时候忙没空去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00058",
      "start_ms": 164640,
      "end_ms": 165680,
      "text": "现在退休了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00059",
      "start_ms": 165780,
      "end_ms": 166555,
      "text": "有空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00060",
      "start_ms": 166920,
      "end_ms": 168295,
      "text": "可不知道该先去哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00061",
      "start_ms": 168760,
      "end_ms": 170285,
      "text": "也不知道去了看什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00062",
      "start_ms": 170900,
      "end_ms": 173225,
      "text": "还有朋友说腿脚不好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00063",
      "start_ms": 173580,
      "end_ms": 175105,
      "text": "有些溶洞爬不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00064",
      "start_ms": 175570,
      "end_ms": 177885,
      "text": "有没有不用爬山也能看的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00065",
      "start_ms": 178270,
      "end_ms": 180010,
      "text": "还有带孙子孙女的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00066",
      "start_ms": 180130,
      "end_ms": 183395,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲这些山洞的来历。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184000,
      "end_ms": 185225,
      "text": "可自己也说不全，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00068",
      "start_ms": 186150,
      "end_ms": 187485,
      "text": "咱们这个年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00069",
      "start_ms": 187890,
      "end_ms": 189150,
      "text": "不光是看个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00070",
      "start_ms": 189150,
      "end_ms": 191654,
      "text": "是想知道这山这水有什么讲究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00071",
      "start_ms": 191970,
      "end_ms": 192785,
      "text": "有什么故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00072",
      "start_ms": 193330,
      "end_ms": 196000,
      "text": "可手机上刷完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00073",
      "start_ms": 196000,
      "end_ms": 199035,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00074",
      "start_ms": 199300,
      "end_ms": 200445,
      "text": "又看的眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00075",
      "start_ms": 200960,
      "end_ms": 205325,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00076",
      "start_ms": 205850,
      "end_ms": 207670,
      "text": "左边一页是实景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00077",
      "start_ms": 207670,
      "end_ms": 209645,
      "text": "大图加一段冷知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00078",
      "start_ms": 210090,
      "end_ms": 211935,
      "text": "右边是日期记事夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00079",
      "start_ms": 212330,
      "end_ms": 213505,
      "text": "什么季节去哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00080",
      "start_ms": 213780,
      "end_ms": 214640,
      "text": "走哪条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00081",
      "start_ms": 214740,
      "end_ms": 216395,
      "text": "看什么风景最合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00082",
      "start_ms": 216640,
      "end_ms": 217865,
      "text": "都给你安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00083",
      "start_ms": 218490,
      "end_ms": 219795,
      "text": "今天翻到至金洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00084",
      "start_ms": 220130,
      "end_ms": 221535,
      "text": "明天翻到芙蓉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00085",
      "start_ms": 221900,
      "end_ms": 222680,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00086",
      "start_ms": 222860,
      "end_ms": 225600,
      "text": "就觉得那个地方在喊你能去的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00087",
      "start_ms": 225820,
      "end_ms": 228560,
      "text": "出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00088",
      "start_ms": 228560,
      "end_ms": 229300,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00089",
      "start_ms": 229540,
      "end_ms": 230815,
      "text": "看的就不是石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00090",
      "start_ms": 231050,
      "end_ms": 233245,
      "text": "是故事去不了的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00091",
      "start_ms": 233460,
      "end_ms": 234720,
      "text": "翻翻书看看图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00092",
      "start_ms": 235080,
      "end_ms": 236105,
      "text": "也算去过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00093",
      "start_ms": 237150,
      "end_ms": 239040,
      "text": "放茶几上孙子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00094",
      "start_ms": 239040,
      "end_ms": 239840,
      "text": "孙女来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00095",
      "start_ms": 239860,
      "end_ms": 241470,
      "text": "翻两页长知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00096",
      "start_ms": 241470,
      "end_ms": 241895,
      "text": "不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00097",
      "start_ms": 242200,
      "end_ms": 243805,
      "text": "写作文都用得上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00098",
      "start_ms": 244220,
      "end_ms": 245525,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻番，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00099",
      "start_ms": 245790,
      "end_ms": 248675,
      "text": "商量明年去哪比刷手机有意思多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00100",
      "start_ms": 248950,
      "end_ms": 250155,
      "text": "我已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00101",
      "start_ms": 250600,
      "end_ms": 251965,
      "text": "点开就能看到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00102",
      "start_ms": 252220,
      "end_ms": 253305,
      "text": "暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00103",
      "start_ms": 253750,
      "end_ms": 255755,
      "text": "咱就把祖国装进屋里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00104",
      "start_ms": 257310,
      "end_ms": 257855,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00105",
      "start_ms": 258280,
      "end_ms": 262455,
      "text": "重庆芙蓉洞在重庆武隆芙蓉江畔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00106",
      "start_ms": 262880,
      "end_ms": 270895,
      "text": "这洞最绝的是他是中国唯一一个被列入世界自然遗产名录的天然洞穴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00107",
      "start_ms": 271980,
      "end_ms": 274565,
      "text": "全长两千三百九十二米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00108",
      "start_ms": 275120,
      "end_ms": 279105,
      "text": "跟美国的猛犸洞、法国的克拉姆斯杜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00109",
      "start_ms": 279900,
      "end_ms": 281865,
      "text": "并称世界三大洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00110",
      "start_ms": 282850,
      "end_ms": 284950,
      "text": "芙蓉洞里近三十种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00111",
      "start_ms": 285070,
      "end_ms": 286825,
      "text": "喀斯特沉积形态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00112",
      "start_ms": 287640,
      "end_ms": 291065,
      "text": "石忠儒、石损石柱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00113",
      "start_ms": 292580,
      "end_ms": 302555,
      "text": "时代石葡萄珊瑚金花几乎包括了钟乳师所有沉疾类型数量之多、形态之美国内罕见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00114",
      "start_ms": 302940,
      "end_ms": 304715,
      "text": "被洞穴专家誉为。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00115",
      "start_ms": 305030,
      "end_ms": 308170,
      "text": "一座斑斓辉煌的地下艺术宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00116",
      "start_ms": 308310,
      "end_ms": 311170,
      "text": "一座内容丰富的洞穴科学博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00117",
      "start_ms": 311830,
      "end_ms": 314410,
      "text": "它形成于大约一百二十多万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00118",
      "start_ms": 314410,
      "end_ms": 317750,
      "text": "年前一百二十万年漫漫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00119",
      "start_ms": 317750,
      "end_ms": 318710,
      "text": "长漫漫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00120",
      "start_ms": 318710,
      "end_ms": 322170,
      "text": "长长出了这一栋的千姿百态。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00121",
      "start_ms": 322890,
      "end_ms": 328570,
      "text": "您说这是洞还是一座用一百二十万年盖起来的地下宫殿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00122",
      "start_ms": 329050,
      "end_ms": 329650,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00123",
      "start_ms": 330210,
      "end_ms": 333250,
      "text": "广西芦狄岩在广西桂林。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00124",
      "start_ms": 333810,
      "end_ms": 336860,
      "text": "这洞最绝的的是它被叫做国宾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00125",
      "start_ms": 336920,
      "end_ms": 339560,
      "text": "洞洞深两百四十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00126",
      "start_ms": 339820,
      "end_ms": 341060,
      "text": "游长五百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00127",
      "start_ms": 341400,
      "end_ms": 343019,
      "text": "形成于三亿年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00128",
      "start_ms": 343580,
      "end_ms": 349440,
      "text": "洞内分布狮岭、朝霞、水晶宫等三十多处钟乳石景观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00129",
      "start_ms": 349640,
      "end_ms": 359420,
      "text": "整个岩洞犹如一座用宝石、珊瑚、翡翠雕砌而成的宏伟壮丽的地下宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00130",
      "start_ms": 359660,
      "end_ms": 362060,
      "text": "被誉为大自然艺术之宫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00131",
      "start_ms": 362840,
      "end_ms": 364220,
      "text": "卢堤岩开放以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00132",
      "start_ms": 364240,
      "end_ms": 366235,
      "text": "接待过四千多万游客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00133",
      "start_ms": 366640,
      "end_ms": 370605,
      "text": "先后接待过三百多位国内外元首和政要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00134",
      "start_ms": 371450,
      "end_ms": 377985,
      "text": "邓小平来过尼克松来过卡特来过联合国前秘书长德奎利亚尔也来过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00135",
      "start_ms": 379060,
      "end_ms": 380040,
      "text": "一九八六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00136",
      "start_ms": 380060,
      "end_ms": 381945,
      "text": "西游记拍东海龙宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00137",
      "start_ms": 382510,
      "end_ms": 384025,
      "text": "取景帝就是卢迪言。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00138",
      "start_ms": 384510,
      "end_ms": 388875,
      "text": "您说这是溶洞还是大自然亲手盖的一座国宾馆？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00139",
      "start_ms": 389080,
      "end_ms": 389495,
      "text": "第一名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00140",
      "start_ms": 390090,
      "end_ms": 393785,
      "text": "贵州至金洞在贵州毕节至金县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00141",
      "start_ms": 394370,
      "end_ms": 398025,
      "text": "这洞最绝的是他被叫做中国溶洞之王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00142",
      "start_ms": 398560,
      "end_ms": 399625,
      "text": "二零零五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00143",
      "start_ms": 399990,
      "end_ms": 406155,
      "text": "中国国家地理杂志评选中国最美旅游洞穴织金洞排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00144",
      "start_ms": 407150,
      "end_ms": 410485,
      "text": "中国最美的六大旅游洞穴之首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00145",
      "start_ms": 410970,
      "end_ms": 412765,
      "text": "中国十大奇洞之首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00146",
      "start_ms": 413220,
      "end_ms": 420085,
      "text": "中科院下辖的中国国家地理等国家级地理研究部门也给予高度赞誉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00147",
      "start_ms": 420650,
      "end_ms": 423175,
      "text": "称他为中国溶洞之王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00148",
      "start_ms": 423730,
      "end_ms": 425730,
      "text": "并留下了黄山归来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00149",
      "start_ms": 425950,
      "end_ms": 427270,
      "text": "不看月织，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00150",
      "start_ms": 427270,
      "end_ms": 429620,
      "text": "今洞外无洞天的感叹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00151",
      "start_ms": 429780,
      "end_ms": 431735,
      "text": "洞长六点六公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00152",
      "start_ms": 432200,
      "end_ms": 434365,
      "text": "最宽处一百七十五米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00153",
      "start_ms": 434830,
      "end_ms": 436385,
      "text": "相对高差一百五十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00154",
      "start_ms": 437260,
      "end_ms": 439665,
      "text": "全动容积五百万立方米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00155",
      "start_ms": 440050,
      "end_ms": 446545,
      "text": "有上中下三层四十七个厅堂一百五十多个景点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00156",
      "start_ms": 446980,
      "end_ms": 450005,
      "text": "最大的动听面积三万多平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00157",
      "start_ms": 450540,
      "end_ms": 453225,
      "text": "洞内有四十多种岩溶堆积物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00158",
      "start_ms": 453740,
      "end_ms": 456620,
      "text": "最出名的是那棵银榆树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00159",
      "start_ms": 456960,
      "end_ms": 457855,
      "text": "高十七米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00160",
      "start_ms": 458160,
      "end_ms": 459085,
      "text": "通体洁白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00161",
      "start_ms": 459480,
      "end_ms": 461375,
      "text": "由结晶方解释构成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00162",
      "start_ms": 462000,
      "end_ms": 463315,
      "text": "五十六层年轮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00163",
      "start_ms": 463930,
      "end_ms": 467185,
      "text": "记录了第四季冰川期的气候信息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00164",
      "start_ms": 467600,
      "end_ms": 469310,
      "text": "被称为地球之花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00165",
      "start_ms": 469450,
      "end_ms": 473075,
      "text": "别的钟乳石都是慢慢滴水长成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00166",
      "start_ms": 473550,
      "end_ms": 476345,
      "text": "银雨术是被水滴砸出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00167",
      "start_ms": 477290,
      "end_ms": 478375,
      "text": "砸了几万年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00168",
      "start_ms": 479150,
      "end_ms": 482425,
      "text": "砸出了一身像花椰菜一样的水晶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00169",
      "start_ms": 484290,
      "end_ms": 487880,
      "text": "您说这是石头还是地球开出来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00170",
      "start_ms": 487880,
      "end_ms": 488605,
      "text": "一朵花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00171",
      "start_ms": 489510,
      "end_ms": 491805,
      "text": "这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00172",
      "start_ms": 492720,
      "end_ms": 493945,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00173",
      "start_ms": 494770,
      "end_ms": 496765,
      "text": "这十处洞穴奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00174",
      "start_ms": 497490,
      "end_ms": 502160,
      "text": "没有一处是光靠好看出名的雪玉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00175",
      "start_ms": 502160,
      "end_ms": 504390,
      "text": "靠的是最年轻石花洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00176",
      "start_ms": 504570,
      "end_ms": 507310,
      "text": "靠的是八层楼天泉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00177",
      "start_ms": 507470,
      "end_ms": 510155,
      "text": "靠的是空间规模世界第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00178",
      "start_ms": 510940,
      "end_ms": 514340,
      "text": "龙宫靠的是中国最大洞中瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00179",
      "start_ms": 514540,
      "end_ms": 520605,
      "text": "双河洞靠的是亚洲第一长洞本溪水洞靠的是坐着船漂进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00180",
      "start_ms": 521100,
      "end_ms": 524465,
      "text": "腾龙洞靠的是整条江被吞进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00181",
      "start_ms": 524920,
      "end_ms": 527935,
      "text": "芙蓉洞靠的是唯一世界遗产洞穴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00182",
      "start_ms": 528650,
      "end_ms": 530305,
      "text": "卢狄岩靠的是国宾洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00183",
      "start_ms": 530650,
      "end_ms": 533685,
      "text": "织金洞靠的是中国溶洞之王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00184",
      "start_ms": 534180,
      "end_ms": 537805,
      "text": "每一处洞穴的厉害之处都不在它有多深。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00185",
      "start_ms": 538080,
      "end_ms": 540345,
      "text": "在他有多奇点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_801c9248f1d13659_s00186",
      "start_ms": 540890,
      "end_ms": 542255,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
